# A tiny stand-in for the RadioID DMRIds.dat export, for the accessibility scan
# only. The real table is 311,146 rows and 6.4 MB and is downloaded at runtime;
# a scan must not depend on the network, and a scan of the Phonebook panel's
# public-list search must not depend on whether it succeeded.
#
# KN4OQW deliberately carries TWO ids. The panel renders one row per issued id,
# and the seed imports the first — so the scan meets the list in its most
# interesting state: one entry marked "already added" beside one still addable.
#
# Same tab-separated shape as the real export: id, callsign, first name.
3100001	W1AW	Hiram
3100002	K2ABC	Pat
3101901	N0SZ	Rocky
3180202	KN4OQW	Clint
3180203	KN4OQW	Clint
